  &lt;li&gt;Silhouette analysis determined the optimal number of clusters and PCA explored dominant variance patterns across NCP layers.&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Random forest models identified the dominant climatic and land-use drivers of NCP changes for each archetype.&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Climate suitability projections for over 7,000 species were compared with NCP change patterns to assess biodiversity–NCP alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
